{"id": 1012804, "slug": "shroomtopia", "name": "Shroomtopia", "name_original": "Shroomtopia", "description": "<p>Be charmed by the cute and colorful world of <strong>Shroomtopia</strong>! Relax in this wholesome slow-paced puzzle game while exploring serene landscapes and solving diverse challenges. Manipulate the hexagonal soil and blend the colors. Only you can bring nature back to life!<br/><br/><br/><br/>Unleash your creativity with a built-in level editor Become a level designer with this intuitive but powerful tool.<br/><br/><br/><br/>And more: <br/></p><ul><li><strong>🍄 Discover 5 diverse and colorful biomes</strong> <br/>A real 2D eye candy full of cute mushroom characters and animated weather effects.<br/></li><li>🗺️ <strong>75 levels packed with puzzles gradually increasing in challenge </strong><br/>Train your brain through logical problems - can you beat all of them?<br/></li><li>🛍️ <strong>Share your designs and play other fan-made maps thanks to the Steam Workshop </strong><br/>Upload the newly made creations, share them with your friends and other fans, and get feedback.<br/></li><li>🎶 <strong>Relax to the soothing soundtrack made by the indie music producer Felipe Peticov Breathe in, breathe out. </strong><br/>What a better way to unwind than these beautiful instrumental sounds?</li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-10-23", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-10-24T16:49:59", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/288/288febd41ba069ff75c4e1438e5a6d48.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/cb5/cb5c84ae3048c7b1bb6efe794825181e.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo":