zles gradually increasing in challenge\nTrain your brain through logical problems - can you beat all of them?\n🛍️ Share your designs and play other fan-made maps thanks to the Steam Workshop\nUpload the newly made creations, share them with your friends and other fans, and get feedback.\n🎶 Relax to the soothing soundtrack made by the indie music producer Felipe Peticov Breathe in, breathe out.\nWhat a better way to unwind than these beautiful instrumental sounds?"}